other common apps

00:17:52.350 --> 00:17:55.690
we see customers building
for their deskless workers.

00:17:55.690 --> 00:17:58.210
We've talked a lot about
field service and inspections

00:17:58.210 --> 00:17:59.260
and audits.

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:01.090
But we also see
people using actually

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:04.070
